{"4068980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Beach Life Simulator", "steam_appid": 4068980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4079880], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068980/extras/1a23e0bfeb3e6bec00d5ab4ec144f267.avif?t=1785541358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068980/extras_big/1a23e0bfeb3e6bec00d5ab4ec144f267.webp?t=1785541358 width=1560 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a life of sun, sand, and dreams in <strong>Beach Life Simulator</strong>! Developed by a solo creator, this game is inspired by the vibrant beaches of Brazil, featuring detailed visuals powered by Unreal Engine, cultural references, and playful national memes — all with a focus on creativity, fun, and an authentically Brazilian vibe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied gameplay</strong>: Start with simple jobs like street vendor, kiosk attendant, or supermarket worker, and grow your career by unlocking new opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social life &amp; leisure</strong>: Play street soccer, basketball, meet friends, or simply relax by the seaside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic world</strong>: Explore living environments with weather, natural lighting, and details that create an immersive tropical atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brazilian style</strong>: Cultural references and light-hearted humor bring authenticity to the experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin small with simple jobs such as street vendor, kiosk attendant, or market employee.<br>As you progress, aim higher — perhaps become a business owner and build your very own beach empire!<br>Beyond work, enjoy plenty of leisure activities: chill by the ocean, play soccer, basketball, or hang out with friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Vision</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer mode</strong> is under consideration: the idea is to play together with friends, though no date is set yet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuous updates</strong> through devlogs (on YouTube) showcasing progress, new mechanics, visual improvements, and additional content.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068980/extras/1a23e0bfeb3e6bec00d5ab4ec144f267.avif?t=1785541358\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068980/extras_big/1a23e0bfeb3e6bec00d5ab4ec144f267.webp?t=1785541358 width=1560 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live a life of sun, sand, and dreams in <strong>Beach Life Simulator</strong>! Developed by a solo creator, this game is inspired by the vibrant beaches of Brazil, featuring detailed visuals powered by Unreal Engine, cultural references, and playful national memes — all with a focus on creativity, fun, and an authentically Brazilian vibe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied gameplay</strong>: Start with simple jobs like street vendor, kiosk attendant, or supermarket worker, and grow your career by unlocking new opportunities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social life &amp; leisure</strong>: Play street soccer, basketball, meet friends, or simply relax by the seaside.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic world</strong>: Explore living environments with weather, natural lighting, and details that create an immersive tropical atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brazilian style</strong>: Cultural references and light-hearted humor bring authenticity to the experience.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Begin small with simple jobs such as street vendor, kiosk attendant, or market employee.<br>As you progress, aim higher — perhaps become a business owner and build your very own beach empire!<br>Beyond work, enjoy plenty of leisure activities: chill by the ocean, play soccer, basketball, or hang out with friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Future Vision</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer mode</strong> is under consideration: the idea is to play together with friends, though no date is set yet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Continuous updates</strong> through devlogs (on YouTube) showcasing progress, new mechanics, visual improvements, and additional content.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Work, play, and explore a tropical life inspired by Brazilian beaches. From street vendor to business owner, create your own story in Beach Life Simulator", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068980/18aa323f7b63a5a4737cc1f04cc84a6e7078c839/header.jpg?t=1785541358", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068980/2fe820a339f4ce4544261da22bfdffb78c44af6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785541358", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4068980/2fe820a339f4ce4544261da22bfdffb78c44af6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785541358", "website": "https://beachsim.areaz12server.net.br/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum":